{#
    The month: the grid and the rail beside it.

    Month navigation swaps this rather than the grid alone, because the rail's
    insight card describes the month on screen — paging to December and leaving
    "two trials convert this month" behind from September would be a card that
    contradicts the grid it sits next to.

    The rail comes after the grid in source order. On a phone the two stack,
    and a calendar pushed below two cards is not the calendar page; the same
    order is what a keyboard walks.
#}
<div id="calendar-month" class="calendar-layout">
    {% include 'calendar/_grid.twig' %}

    <aside class="calendar-rail" aria-label="{{ t('calendar.rail') }}">
        {% include 'calendar/_insight.twig' %}
        {% include 'calendar/_upcoming.twig' %}
    </aside>
</div>
